dsh-session-dots
================

This plugin re-implements the sidebar status-dot behaviour of

  dsh-sessions-manager
  Copyright (c) 2026 TOBYCAI
  https://github.com/TOBYCAI/dsh-sessions-manager
  MIT License

The host state -> dot state mapping (manual / running / feedback / done /
error), the "done hides while the row is selected" rule, and the
`dsm-manual-unread-v1` storage key are taken from that project so the two can
coexist without disagreeing. No other part of the upstream plugin is included.

The upstream license text is reproduced in ./LICENSE-UPSTREAM.
